    "description": "Satisfy your late-night cookie cravings with the Insomnia Cookies Mobile App!\ud83c\udf6a\ud83c\udf19\r\n\r\nDiscover your nearest Insomnia Cookies location and seamlessly place orders for pick-up or delivery until 3am. Whether you\u2019re treating yourself after a marathon study session or sending a sweet gift, Insomnia Cookies has you covered.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\u25cf Convenient Ordering: A few taps and your warm, delicious cookies are on their way.\r\n\u25cf Late-Night Delights: We\u2019re open until 3am, so your cravings won\u2019t go unanswered.\r\n\u25cf Gift Options: Surprise someone special with a box of freshly baked cookies.\r\n\u25cf Insomnia Rewards: Every order gets you closer to mouthwatering rewards\r\n\r\nDownload the Insomnia Cookies app now and indulge in cookie bliss! \ud83d\udcf2\ud83c\udf6a",
